"distributed edge load balancer, event-driven HTTP workers, in-process "
"exchanges, simple setup and run-time configuration, traffic policy, edge "
"observability, automatic HTTPS, replicated bans, cluster configuration, "
"TLS on the workers, shared affinity and fleet caps, peer forwarding, the "
"spill cache, the database authority, the upgrade handoff, plugin tiers, "
"the operator console of the edge, and staged admission."
msgstr ""
